span.p:
LAYER 1 - HTTP edge, base path /api/audio.
@PreAuthorize on every handler, and the
authority does not track the HTTP verb -
audio:read on GET list, /search and by code;
audio:create on POST and POST /bulk;
audio:update on both PATCH routes;
audio:delete on DELETE, on POST restore, on
GET /trash and on DELETE purge.
@EnableMethodSecurity in SecurityConfig makes
that check fire before the method body.
parseAndValidate Jackson-parses the multipart
data part then runs the bean Validator by
hand, raising AudioValidationException with a
field-error map.
create returns 200, not 201; only delete and
purge return 204.
